        },
        {
          "text": " Koumokis lukiirarete kere, kotemasi atiar, “Mere lo etuŋanan loabu komuna ŋul lukiwoneete ekiror ŋol koYerusalem? Ne da abu kobunite kanuka akirot kaŋin ajen kes ka ayaŋaar mama ejaas isasedotin lupeti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
